    "detailed_description": "<h1>Important News</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">English version coming soon!</h2>You're welcome to download our game in advance, and add it to your Steam library!<br><br>Then you'll see the announcement as soon as the English version is released~!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Follow/Contact Us at:</h2>Twitter/Youtube/Patreon: @EternalDream0v0<br>Discord:<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:eternaldream0v0@163.com\">eternaldream0v0@163.com</a><br><br>You may click on developer name to enter our Steam Developer page to learn more about us.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/3453c2b8ea15ff026e783552212e48f8.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>&quot;Being out of the ordinary is not a blessing from the gods, but a sin against them.&quot;<br>All recuperators in sanatorium<strong> Kepler-452b</strong> are <strong>&quot;ABNormals&quot;</strong> with different abilities. <br><br>Most people can't accept the differences between extraordinary individuals and themselves.<br>Marginalizing &quot;the special&quot; or trying to &quot;normalize&quot; the abnormal is in our human nature. <br>As a result, more and more recuperators are sent here.<br><br>The fortune earned from the treatment cost is spent on advanced technologies, new equipment, staff salaries, and everything else in the sanatorium. A fair exchange - both sides get what they need.<br><br>However, one doubt always remains in my mind...<br><strong>None of the recuperators I've cared for have left, so why have none of their families questioned it?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3007About Main Characters\u3007</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/58b718d26be86c08c562aa43843964fa.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Carina<br>The manager of the second and third floors. She helps to keep the sanatorium running.<br>Abilities: Healing and mind-control<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/e3ec3c300248c7f2794c07d48f2ca6d7.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Marie<br>A well-behaved new recuperator who is somewhat timid and looks forward to going home.<br>Ability: Liquid void<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/012e455d7d078dc71a2b09d19f9596cd.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Noel<br>Tells bad jokes anytime and anywhere. Friendly and easygoing, keen on bringing warmth with his personality.<br>Ability: Eternal chill<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/c52c6a0bb8640e956f4b12a69e5b1950.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Voss<br>A bold and cheerful recuperator. Calls herself &quot;Voss the Brave&quot; and loves trying new things.<br>Ability: Solar X-ray vision<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/767dec6fa784d7735769f87005624a13.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Zoey <br>Twin sister of Voss. Calm and reserved. Shows particular hostility toward Carina.<br>Ability: Lunar X-ray vision<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/dc1691f7b8d4147481cbba59482b419d.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Modi<br>Reliable repairman, good at fixing all sorts of things. Has an unknown past.<br>Ability: None<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/82a55a8374d6253d789d96dc02179601.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Dr. Chimaz <br>Director of the sanatorium. Cares about all the recuperators and wants to make the sanatorium feel like a second home for them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/0e9dc5305f4300522c53f2f02eca6bb6.avif?t=1720597891\" /></div><br>Light<br>Type Beta-T913 medical robot. The manager of the first and fourth floors. One of the most loyal assistants in the sanatorium.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3007About This Game\u3007</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/cc8fbadeb60b831fae163630b331dcc2.poster.avif?t=1720597891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1122750/extras/cc8fbadeb60b831fae163630b331dcc2.webm?t=1720597891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>A pixel art role-playing game with a dramatic story line.<br>You can explore the map, solve puzzles, and make choices.<br><br>There are some easy QTEs in the process.<br><br>[Playtime]<br>About 2-3 hours<br><br>[Ending]<br>There are 7 endings.<br>Get the True Ending by selecting new dialog after collecting Bad Ending 3, Bad Ending 4, Normal Ending and Happy Ending.<br><br>[Hotkeys]<br>Arrow keys: Move<br>Shift: Dash <br>Space/Z/Enter: Interact/Confirm<br>Esc/X: Show Menu/Cancel <br>Ctrl: Fast-forward Dialog<br>F1: Key config",
